model l4_span
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.3 (#247), the plan's §8.4: book/ledger.rs ledger_model on a hole-day instance (MUTANTS-SURVIVORS, the guard span.contains(last) set to true). pw's day is a window row across March's end, a hole day in 2.3, fulfilled by an observation dated 2026-03-30; a ledger over April and May leaves that day out, so it holds no line for pw, and one over March to May holds it in March"

source s "s"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN
input w: date
input bank: observed

move pw: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = window(2026-03-25, 2026-04-05) "s"

version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03 .. 2026-05
  known 2026-06-05
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  stated[konto] = 600.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "s"
  stated[konto] = 600.00 PLN at 2026-05-31 end "s"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-30, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 100.00 PLN, fulfils: pw) "r1"

ask r_late: residuals konto 2026-04 .. 2026-05
ask r_all: residuals konto 2026-03 .. 2026-05
ask r_apr: residuals konto 2026-04
ask r_p05: residuals konto 2026-04 .. 2026-05 with w = 2026-04-05
